{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14242","headline":"谒诸葛武侯庙 · 窦常","name":"谒诸葛武侯庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"永安宫外有祠堂，鱼水恩深祚不长。\n角立一方初退舍，拟称三汉更图王。\n人同过隟无留影，石在穷沙尚啓行。\n归蜀降吴竟何事，爲陵爲谷共苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}